'''Ape Lord's Revenge''' is the seventh stage in [[Humanity Catified]]. This [[No Continues]] stage drops 2 [[Platinum Capsules (Gacha Event)|Platinum Shards]] when cleared for the first time. [[Formicidaean Ariant]] and [[Cumulus Gallus]] make their first Uncanny Legends appearances here.

